+Car+PxSg3+So/CP:тӧг»ыс K ;
+Car+PxSg3+So/CP+Err/Orth-e-not-oe:тэг»ыс K ;
+Car+PxPl3+So/CP:тӧг»ыс K ;
+Car+PxPl3+So/CP+Err/Orth-e-not-oe:тэг»ыс K ;

LEXICON COM_K
+Com:кӧд K ;
+Com+Err/Orth-e-not-oe:кед K ;

LEXICON COM_PX_SO/CP_K
+Com+PxSg2+So/PC:ыд»кӧд K ;
+Com+PxSg2+So/PC+Err/Orth-e-not-oe:ыд»кед K ;
+Com+PxSg3+So/PC:ыс»кӧд K ;
+Com+PxSg3+So/PC+Err/Orth-e-not-oe:ыс»кед K ;
+Com+PxPl2+So/PC:ныд»кӧд K ;
+Com+PxPl2+So/PC+Err/Orth-e-not-oe:ныд»кед K ;
+Com+PxPl3+So/PC:ныс»кӧд K ;
+Com+PxPl3+So/PC+Err/Orth-e-not-oe:ныс»кед K ;

LEXICON DAT_K
+Dat:лы K ;

